  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Master&apos;s Degree Program in Engergy Science and Policy(2023)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our focus is on establishing energy and environmental policies nurturing leaders in this field and enhancing the organizational and institutional capacity of relevant government departments or agencies involved in formulating energy and environmental policies</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We aim to cultivate key talents who can lead policy cultural and institutional changes through the application of an energy policy perspective in the national development process of partner countries&#xd504;&#xb85c;&#xadf8;&#xb7a8;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd574; &#xc5d0;&#xb108;&#xc9c0; &#xbc0f; &#xd658;&#xacbd; &#xbd84;&#xc57c;&#xc5d0;&#xc11c; &#xc790;&#xad6d;&#xc758; &#xc815;&#xcc45;&#xc744; &#xc218;&#xb9bd;&#xd558;&#xace0;, &#xc2e4;&#xd589;&#xd558;&#xace0;, &#xd3c9;&#xac00;&#xd560; &#xc218; &#xc788;&#xb294; &#xc804;&#xbb38;&#xc131;&#xacfc; &#xb9ac;&#xb354;&#xc2ed;&#xc744; &#xb3d9;&#xc2dc;&#xc5d0; &#xbc30;&#xc591;&#xd560; &#xc218; &#xc788;&#xc744; &#xac83;&#xc73c;&#xb85c; &#xae30;&#xb300;&#xb428;</narrative>
